v3r=U("- Use `agent read NAME` to catch up on what an agent said, and `agent wait NAME` only when you genuinely need the answer before going on."),Dk4=T(),y3r=0,z3r=U("- Suspend agents that are idle with nothing left to do when the user agrees or asks (`agent suspend NAME` \u2014 it ends the process but keeps the agent and its conversation), and `agent resume NAME` them when their work comes back. Never suspend a busy agent without asking."),Ek4=T(),C3r=0,D3r=U("- Keep the team's descriptions current: every so often, and whenever the user asks about the team, `agent refresh NAME` the agents whose title, description or bio is missing or stale (a couple of hours old). An agent answers a refresh by describing itself; you do not need to write it."),
